description: This project must use HTML and CSS only, with no JavaScript.
alwaysApply: true
---

# HTML and CSS only

- This restriction applies to every page and future website change in this project.
- Do not add JavaScript files, script elements, JavaScript URLs, inline event handlers, or libraries and frameworks that require JavaScript.
- Use native HTML controls and CSS for interactions. Navigation links must use ordinary anchor elements with `href` attributes.
- Reuse `css/style.css` as the single shared stylesheet.
- Keep any temporary verification programs outside this project.
